@guide A_Feralas
@name Feralas (Feathermoon Stronghold)
@faction Alliance
@levels 43-47
@zone Feralas
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Feathermoon Stronghold, the Hatecrest naga, the missing courier chain and the Grimtotem and gnoll camps.
@next A_Hinterlands

fp Feathermoon Stronghold
bind Feathermoon Stronghold [area=1116]
accept The Ruins of Solarsal | Shandris Feathermoon.
turnin The Ruins of Solarsal | The gazebo on the island south.
accept Return to Feathermoon Stronghold
turnin Return to Feathermoon Stronghold
accept 3130 Against the Hatecrest
accept The Missing Courier | Latronicus Moonspear.
complete 3130 Against the Hatecrest | Hatecrest naga at the Ruins of Solarsal.
turnin 3130 Against the Hatecrest
accept 2869 Against the Hatecrest
complete 2869 Against the Hatecrest | Hatecrest Naga Scale drops from Hatecrest Serpent Guard, Hatecrest Warrior and Hatecrest Wave Rider and others.
turnin 2869 Against the Hatecrest
accept Against Lord Shalzaru
complete Against Lord Shalzaru [group=2] | Lord Shalzaru, in the cave on the isle.
turnin Against Lord Shalzaru
turnin The Missing Courier | Ginro Hearthkindle on the mainland dock.
accept 4125 The Missing Courier
turnin 4125 The Missing Courier
accept Boat Wreckage
turnin Boat Wreckage
accept The Knife Revealed
turnin The Knife Revealed
accept Psychometric Reading
turnin Psychometric Reading
accept The Woodpaw Gnolls
complete The Woodpaw Gnolls | Woodpaw gnolls in the southern hills.
accept Freedom for All Creatures | Kindal Moonweaver, at the camp east.
complete Freedom for All Creatures [group=2] | Escort the sprite darters out of the Grimtotem compound.
turnin Freedom for All Creatures
accept 2970 Doling Justice
complete 2970 Doling Justice | Grimtotem tauren at the compound.
turnin 2970 Doling Justice
turnin The Woodpaw Gnolls
accept The Writhing Deep
complete The Writhing Deep | Inside the Zukk'ash hive at the Writhing Deep.
turnin The Writhing Deep
accept Freed from the Hive | Escort quest: start it when you are ready to follow.
accept Zapped Giants | Zorbin Fandazzle, the coast.
accept Fuel for the Zapping | Needs level 45. If you are lower, TBCGuide skips it and moves on.
complete Zapped Giants | Use the Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker on Wave Striders and Land Walkers.
complete Fuel for the Zapping | Water elementals on the coast.
turnin Zapped Giants
turnin Fuel for the Zapping
turnin Freed from the Hive
accept A Hero's Welcome
turnin A Hero's Welcome
accept The Giant Guardian | Rockbiter at the Twin Colossals.
turnin The Giant Guardian
level 46
train
note Fly to Ironforge, then to Aerie Peak in the Hinterlands (fly from Menethil if you lack the path).
